\newlabel{tab:probe}{{10}{12}{Substitution-probe attribution, in cm of movement of the predicted grasp \emph {offset}, per input channel. The counterexample is the first two rows: v2 and v2.1 agree to within $0.73$\,cm on every channel and score $0.000$ and $0.700$ when deployed. A probe evaluated on teacher trajectories cannot, on its own, certify off-manifold behaviour}{table.caption.46}{}}
